on getShortcutFromImageTable (adrMsgTable, adrName) {
	«Get the name of the shortcut for this picture. It's stored in the image subtable. adrName^ gets the name. Return true if found, false otherwise. The shortcut name may not actually be in the glossary -- when you get the result back from here, don't assume it's in the glossary.
		«01/12/00; 2:29:33 PM by PBS
	
	if not defined (adrMsgTable^.image.shortcut) {
		return (false)};
	
	adrName^ = adrMsgTable^.image.shortcut;
	
	return (true)}